ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080446223592_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080446223592_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯赛事预告】</strong></p><p><strong>7月10日4：00</strong> <strong>世界杯1/4决赛</strong>：<strong>法国vs摩洛哥</strong></p><p><strong>【世界杯资讯】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4ea42fb38c7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：贾斯汀·比伯将与麦当娜 夏奇拉 BTS出演世界杯决赛中场秀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090350165781.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090350165781_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090350165781_720.jpg"> </div><p><span>FIFA官方消息，贾斯汀·比伯将与麦当娜、夏奇拉、防弹少年团一同担任2026年世界杯决赛中场秀的联合领衔嘉宾。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4e923642d5anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：前胜利主帅热苏斯执教葡萄牙，带队直至下届世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090210505213_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090210505213_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090210505213_720.jpg"> </div><p><span>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，前利雅得胜利主帅若热·热苏斯将执教葡萄牙，带队直至下一届世界杯。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4ebac74cd56native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡萄牙出局后首次更新个人社媒！C罗更新社媒动态：永远的葡萄牙</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090502291159.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090502291159_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090502291159_720.jpg"> </div><p><span>葡萄牙0-1西班牙，止步美加墨世界杯16强后，C罗首次更新个人社媒。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4eb6624846cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">霸榜！FIFA实力榜：姆巴佩进攻第1 奥利塞创造力第1 于帕防守第1</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090443222129.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090443222129.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260709/202607090443222129.jpg"> </div><p><span>美加墨世界杯1/8决赛结束，FIFA官方更新实力排行榜，三个关键表现维度中，进攻维度姆巴佩跃升至第一，梅西第二；奥利塞在创造力维度保持第1，于帕超越罗德里，在防守维度排第1。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4e9822dade6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA排本届世界杯比赛：阿根廷3-2佛得角最夯，葡萄牙0-1西班牙较拉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.41" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/6a483e3c1eefb_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.41" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.41" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/6a483e3c1eefb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/6a483e3c1eefb.jpg"> </div><p><span>世界杯1/8决赛已经落幕，本届世界杯只剩最后8场比赛。The Athletic对本届世界杯截至目前每场比赛进行排名，从最差到最好。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4e6793091c7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴洛贡争议！白宫方面回应：不排除未来再干预 裁判有不清白过去</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4e679e2bc42.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4e679e2bc42.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4e679e2bc42.jpg"> </div><p><span>据美国媒体报道，针对巴洛贡红牌停赛暂缓执行的争议，白宫方面再度回应此事，并表示不排除未来再干预体育争议。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4e819a7a2aanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：赖斯、格伊和詹姆斯今日进行个人训练 亨德森在酒店康复</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260709/202607090058379556.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260709/202607090058379556.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260709/202607090058379556.jpg"> </div><p><span>英格兰队官方社媒消息，4名球员在今日并未参加合练。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4e91a39bcecnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">墨西哥足协官方：马克斯出任墨西哥国家队新任主帅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210518/60a3c5531f436.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210518/60a3c5531f436.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210518/60a3c5531f436.jpg"> </div><p>墨西哥足协官方宣布，马克斯成为墨西哥新任主帅，取代了自宣离任的前任主帅阿吉雷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4ead7565e86native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃及足协官方：与国家队主帅胡萨姆·哈桑及领队易卜拉欣·哈桑续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260709/202607090412555702.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260709/202607090412555702.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260709/202607090412555702.jpg"> </div><p><span>埃及足协官方宣布和主帅胡萨姆·哈桑以及领队易卜拉欣·哈桑续约。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-09/6a4e998eec5fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">又来😅巴拉圭议员再批姆巴佩：这个混蛋不和希尔握手还大喊大叫</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" dat